  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "CosFly",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCosFly-Track\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\nThis is the pre-release open-source dataset for the paper CosFly-Track: A Large-Scale Multi-Modal Dataset for UAV Visual Tracking via Multi-Constraint Trajectory Optimization. We currently release a filtered local snapshot, and additional data will be published here in future updates.\nCosFly-Track contains simulated UAV visual tracking trajectories for target tracking and waypoint prediction. Each trajectory records RGB observations, depth\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AutelRobotics/CosFly.",
